---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="The game"><div class="page-shell"><PageHeading eyebrow="Get to know Glob2" title="A colony with a mind of its own." description="Build the big picture. Your globs take care of the small steps."/><figure class="wide-scene"><img src="/images/globulation2-gameplay.webp" width="1280" height="720" alt="Globulation 2 game menu and a colony of turquoise globs surrounded by food, trees and buildings"/><figcaption>The Globulation 2 world and game menu.</figcaption></figure><div class="three-grid"><article class="feature"><h2>Indirect control</h2><p>Assign workers to buildings and use flags to guide your colony. Globs choose their own tasks and routes.</p></article><article class="feature"><h2>A living economy</h2><p>Food sustains your population. Construction and training compete for your workers’ time.</p></article><article class="feature"><h2>Room to experiment</h2><p>Play solo scenarios, face computer opponents, or join other players. Create your own maps in the editor.</p></article></div><section class="split-section"><div><h2>Free to play. Open to change.</h2><p>Globulation 2 is free software. You can study the source, contribute fixes, or help improve its art and translations.</p><a class="text-link" href={site.sourceUrl}>Explore the source →</a></div><div><h2>Find your way in.</h2><p>Start with the in-game tutorial, then use our guides to build a strong first colony.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/learn/">Learn to play</a><a class="button secondary" href="/downloads/">Downloads</a></div></div></section></div></Base>
